   "text": "That was the simulation — this is your coach. You did the two things that de-escalate a billing call: empathy first, then the policy framed as 'what I can do' instead of 'what I can't'. You never pretended the refund limit was negotiable, and you gave them a concrete next step with a timestamp. If they dispute anyway, that paper trail is exactly what the billing team needs."
